Subdomain Gradebook of StudentAcademicRecord
    documentation "An individual assignment in a gradebook is represented as a GradebookEntry. A GradebookEntry may be mapped to LearningStandards. Each student's score for that entry is a StudentGradebookEntry which can be a grade or a CompetencyLevel."
    descriptor AcademicSubject
    descriptor AssignmentLateStatus
    descriptor CareerPathway
    descriptor CompetencyLevel
    domain entity Course
    descriptor CourseDefinedBy
    descriptor CourseGPAApplicability
    descriptor CourseLevelCharacteristic
    descriptor EducationalEnvironment
    domain entity GradebookEntry
    descriptor GradebookEntryType
    descriptor GradeLevel
    descriptor Language
    domain entity LearningStandard
    descriptor LearningStandardCategory
    descriptor LearningStandardScope
    descriptor MediumOfInstruction
    descriptor PopulationServed
    domain entity Section
    descriptor SectionCharacteristic
    descriptor SectionType
    domain entity Student
    domain entity StudentGradebookEntry
    association StudentSectionAssociation
    descriptor SubmissionStatus
    position 3
